      "template": "The condition of the flood defence is {1}. Regarding a possible breach, {2}; water pressure is driven by {3}.\nBehind the flood defence lies an area of the type {4}. The time available for measures is {5}; the potentially affected group consists of {6}.\nThe relocation decision concerns {7}. Basic utilities are {8} and shelter capacity is {9}.\nThe situational picture consists of {10}; coordination among partners takes place through {11}. Public communication is {12}.",
